In FY2025, the key thematic focus areas of ICICI Bank's CSR activities were:
- Healthcare (including healthcare and sanitation, as well as focus on cancer care, cardiac care, and eye care) [ICICIBANK FY2025 p.78, p.128, p.152];
- Environment and ecology (including water conservation, forest interventions and plantation, and renewable energy supply) [ICICIBANK FY2025 p.78, p.128, p.175];
- Livelihoods / livelihood projects [ICICIBANK FY2025 p.78, p.128, p.309]; and
- Community development and social interventions (including financial literacy, fraud awareness, and disaster relief) [ICICIBANK FY2025 p.78, p.128, p.152, p.175].

Environment and healthcare were identified as the major areas of impact for the Bank's CSR activities during fiscal 2025 [ICICIBANK FY2025 p.127].
